The Remaining Challenges
5
The Libra block – Remaining challenges
Identification of fluid contacts
Fluid nature – gas condensate or huge gas cap with oil layer like the Jupiter prospect
Low-sampled fluid volume relative to the reservoir size
Condensate to Gas Ratio Total condensate in place
Development challenges
Heavy CO2 contamination Reservoir quality – effects of thermal recrystallization
Need for additional fluid sampling and appraisal wells
